      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית שֶׁ֫מֶשׁ</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio de lugar (</strong><em>templo do sol</em><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:22\" href=\"/Joshua.19.22\">Js 19.22</a> + 8 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳־שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:10\" href=\"/Joshua.15.10\">Js 15.10</a> + 6 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ שׁ֑מֶשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:38\" href=\"/Joshua.19.38\">Js 19.38</a> + 4 vezes;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  cidade no sudoeste de Judá <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:19\" href=\"/Joshua.15.19\">Js 15.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.9\">1Sm 6.9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.12\">1Sm 6.12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.13\">1Sm 6.13</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.15\">1Sm 6.15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.19\">1Sm 6.19</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.20\">1Sm 6.20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.9\">1Rs 4.9</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.13\">2Rs 14.13</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.23\">2Cr 25.23</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.18\">2Cr 28.18</a>; distinguida de outros lugares de mesmo nome como <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ שׁ׳ אֲשֶׁר לִיהוּדָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.11\">2Rs 14.11</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.21\">2Cr 25.21</a>; atribuída aos levitas <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:16\" href=\"/Joshua.21.16\">Js 21.16</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:44\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.44\">1Cr 6.44</a>;—ruína na atual <em>ʿAin Shems</em> Rob<sup>BR ii. 223 f.</sup> Bd<sup>Pal. 163</sup> Survey<sup>iii. 35, 60</sup>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  cidade em Naftali <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:38\" href=\"/Joshua.19.38\">Js 19.38</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:33\" href=\"/Judges.1.33\">Jz 1.33</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  cidade em Issacar <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:22\" href=\"/Joshua.19.22\">Js 19.22</a>; possivelmente <em>ʿAin esh-Shemsîyeh</em>, vale do Jordão, ao sul de Beisân (Bete-Seã) Survey<sup>ii. 231</sup>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  = Om-Heliópolis, no Egito <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.13\">Jr 43.13</a> Rob<sup>BR i. 25</sup> Eb<sup>GS 505 f.</sup> Dl<sup>Pa 318 f.</sup>",
