      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּכָא</span></big>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] <strong>árvore de bálsamo (</strong>ver árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">بَكْأٌ</span> Dozy<sup>ZMG 1869, 188</sup> mas Löw<sup>No. 47</sup>; segundo TA, semelhante a <span dir=\"rtl\">جرجير</span>, uma <em>eruca</em>, cf. Lane s.v.; talvez cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">بَكَأَ</span> <em>dar pouco leite</em>, do camelo, isto é, <em>gotejar, pingar</em><strong>)</strong>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכָאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.23\">2Sm 5.23</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:24\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.24\">2Sm 5.24</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.14\">1Cr 14.14</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.15\">1Cr 14.15</a>; singular em <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵמֶק הַבָּכָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 84:7\" href=\"/Psalms.84.7\">Sl 84.7</a> <em>vale dos balsameiros</em>, cf. De Che.",
