      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלִיַּ֫עַל</span></big><sub>27</sub>  <strong>substantivo</strong> [<strong>masculino</strong>] <strong>inutilidade (</strong>composto de <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלִי</span> <em>não, sem</em> e <span dir=\"rtl\">יַעַל</span> <em>valor, utilidade, proveito</em><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.14\">Dt 13.14</a> + 20 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלִיָּ֑עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 101:3\" href=\"/Psalms.101.3\">Sl 101.3</a> + 5 vezes;—a qualidade de <em>ser inútil, não servir para nada</em>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  abstrato <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ (ה)בליעל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְשֵׁי הבליעל</span>, <em>indivíduos sem valor, inúteis, vis</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:25\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.25\">1Sm 25.25</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.7\">2Sm 16.7</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.1\">2Sm 20.1</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.13\">1Rs 21.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.27\">Pv 16.27</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:17\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.17\">1Sm 25.17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.14\">Dt 13.14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:22\" href=\"/Judges.19.22\">Jz 19.22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:13\" href=\"/Judges.20.13\">Jz 20.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.12\">1Sm 2.12</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.27\">1Sm 10.27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:10\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.10\">1Rs 21.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.13\">1Rs 21.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.7\">2Cr 13.7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּת ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.16\">1Sm 1.16</a> (mulher embriagada); <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵד ב׳</span> <em>testemunha vil</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.28\">Pv 19.28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבַר ב׳</span> <em>coisa vil, perversa</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 41:9\" href=\"/Psalms.41.9\">Sl 41.9</a> (contudo cf. <strong>3</strong> abaixo), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 101:3\" href=\"/Psalms.101.3\">Sl 101.3</a> (acrescente-se provavelmente também <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 29:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.29.10\">1Sm 29.10</a>, assim 𝔊 We Dr); <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּבָר</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳</span> (elíptico e em aposição) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.9\">Dt 15.9</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  concreto, elíptico de <span dir=\"rtl\">אישׁ ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.6\">2Sm 23.6</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:18\" href=\"/Job.34.18\">Jó 34.18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־אִישׁ רַע וּבְלִיַּעַל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.22\">1Sm 30.22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָדָם בְּלִיַּעַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.12\">Pv 6.12</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>ruína, destruição:</em> assim <a data-ref=\"Psalms 41:9\" href=\"/Psalms.41.9\">Sl 41.9</a> segundo De Che e outros, mas ver acima; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹעֵץ ב׳</span> <em>conselheiro de ruína</em> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:11\" href=\"/Nahum.1.11\">Na 1.11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳</span> sozinho <em>homem de ruína, destruidor</em> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:1\" href=\"/Nahum.2.1\">Na 2.1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחֲלֵי ב׳</span> <em>torrentes de destruição</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאוֹל</span>) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.5\">2Sm 22.5</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:5\" href=\"/Psalms.18.5\">Sl 18.5</a>.",
