      "html": "† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּלַל</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo:</strong> mesclar, misturar, confundir, transtornar <strong>(</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">بَلَّ</span> <em>umedecer</em> (com água), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">بَلَلٌ</span> <em>umidade</em>, assírio <em>balâlu</em>, Dl<sup>Pr 70</sup>; cf. fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">בלל</span> nome de um sacrifício, e neo-hebraico <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּלְבֵּל</span>; aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּלְבֵּל ܒܰܠܒܶܠ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּלַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:9\" href=\"/Genesis.11.9\">Gn 11.9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּ֜לֹּתִ֗י</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:11\" href=\"/Psalms.92.11\">Sl 92.11</a> (mas cf. abaixo); imperfeito, 1.ª pessoa plural <span dir=\"rtl\">נָֽבְלָה</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">נָבֹ֫לָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:7\" href=\"/Genesis.11.7\">Gn 11.7</a>, cf. Kö<sup>i</sup>. <sup>325</sup>; particípio passivo <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּלוּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:40\" href=\"/Exodus.29.40\">Êx 29.40</a> + 3 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלוּלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.5\">Lv 2.5</a> + 28 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלוּלֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:2\" href=\"/Exodus.29.2\">Êx 29.2</a> + 4 vezes;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>mesclar, confundir</em> (objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂפָה</span> = fala, língua, veja-se esse verbete) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:7\" href=\"/Genesis.11.7\">Gn 11.7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:9\" href=\"/Genesis.11.9\">Gn 11.9</a> (J). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>misturar</em> (bolos ou farinha, etc., sempre com azeite), termo técnico sacrificial, somente P, cf. Di sobre <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.4\">Lv 2.4</a>; geralmente como <span dir=\"rtl\">מנחה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">סֹלֶת בּ׳ בַּשֶּׁמֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:40\" href=\"/Exodus.29.40\">Êx 29.40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.5\">Lv 2.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.10\">Lv 14.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.21\">Lv 14.21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.13\">Lv 23.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:13\" href=\"/Numbers.7.13\">Nm 7.13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:19\" href=\"/Numbers.7.19\">Nm 7.19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:25\" href=\"/Numbers.7.25\">Nm 7.25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:31\" href=\"/Numbers.7.31\">Nm 7.31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:37\" href=\"/Numbers.7.37\">Nm 7.37</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:43\" href=\"/Numbers.7.43\">Nm 7.43</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:49\" href=\"/Numbers.7.49\">Nm 7.49</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:55\" href=\"/Numbers.7.55\">Nm 7.55</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:61\" href=\"/Numbers.7.61\">Nm 7.61</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:67\" href=\"/Numbers.7.67\">Nm 7.67</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:73\" href=\"/Numbers.7.73\">Nm 7.73</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:79\" href=\"/Numbers.7.79\">Nm 7.79</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 8:8\" href=\"/Numbers.8.8\">Nm 8.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:4\" href=\"/Numbers.15.4\">Nm 15.4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:6\" href=\"/Numbers.15.6\">Nm 15.6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:9\" href=\"/Numbers.15.9\">Nm 15.9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:5\" href=\"/Numbers.28.5\">Nm 28.5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:9\" href=\"/Numbers.28.9\">Nm 28.9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:12\" href=\"/Numbers.28.12\">Nm 28.12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:13\" href=\"/Numbers.28.13\">Nm 28.13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:20\" href=\"/Numbers.28.20\">Nm 28.20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:28\" href=\"/Numbers.28.28\">Nm 28.28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 29:3\" href=\"/Numbers.29.3\">Nm 29.3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 29:9\" href=\"/Numbers.29.9\">Nm 29.9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 29:14\" href=\"/Numbers.29.14\">Nm 29.14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מנחה ב׳ בשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.10\">Lv 7.10</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרֵבָה</span>) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.4\">Lv 9.4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חַלּוֹת מַצוֹת ב׳ בשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:2\" href=\"/Exodus.29.2\">Êx 29.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.12\">Lv 7.12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, isto é, feitos mediante mistura com azeite; <span dir=\"rtl\">סלת חלות מצות ב׳ בשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.4\">Lv 2.4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">סלת חלות ב׳ בשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:15\" href=\"/Numbers.6.15\">Nm 6.15</a>, isto é, flor de farinha (na forma) de bolos assim feitos. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּ֜לֹּתִ֗י בְּשֶׁמֶן רַעֲנָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:11\" href=\"/Psalms.92.11\">Sl 92.11</a> <em>serei</em> (<em>sou</em>) <em>ungido com azeite fresco</em> AV RV; verbo não empregado em outro lugar neste sentido; 𝔊 𝔙 Hup Che leem <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלֹתִי</span> de <span dir=\"rtl\">בלה</span>, infinitivo construto com sufixo, abstrato pelo concreto, <em>meu definhamento</em> = <em>minha força que definha</em>, de idade avançada; Israel sob a figura de um velho; isto, porém, não é favorecido pelo contexto. A passagem é, portanto, duvidosa.<br><strong>Hitpolel</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְבּוֹלָ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:8\" href=\"/Hosea.7.8\">Os 7.8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אפרים בעמים הוא י׳</span> <em>Efraim, entre os povos ele se mistura;</em> mas Ew Now derivam aqui de <span dir=\"rtl\">בלל</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">בלה</span> (ou <span dir=\"rtl\">נבל</span>) <em>definhar</em>, cf. Hifil<br><strong>Hifil</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַנָּ֫בֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 64:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.64.5\">Is 64.5</a> <em>e desvanecemos</em>, mas talvez se leia <span dir=\"rtl\">וַנִּבֹּל</span> de <span dir=\"rtl\">נבל</span> cf. Di (De, menos provavelmente, deriva de <span dir=\"rtl\">בלל</span>—cf. Ew Now <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:8\" href=\"/Hosea.7.8\">Os 7.8</a>—ou <span dir=\"rtl\">בול</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">נבל</span>).",
